The nutrient registry (registry/nutrients.json) contains component codes, names,
units, groups and formulas from the component table of the Bundeslebensmittelschlüssel
4.0, licensed under CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/):

Max Rubner-Institut (2025): Bundeslebensmittelschlüssel (BLS), Version 4.0 — Deutsche
Nährstoffdatenbank. Karlsruhe. DOI: 10.25826/Data20251217-134202-0
